      "claim": "Ashford defines \"backup duties\" as obligations to donate to effective aid agencies when primary duties (such as structural reform) cannot be fully met.",
      "evidence": "In Ashford’s discussion of effective altruism she distinguishes primary duties (directly changing institutions) from backup duties (supporting aid agencies) as a fallback moral requirement.",
